Program 6
Write a program to construct a Bayesian network considering medical data. Use this model to
demonstrate the diagnosis of heart patients using Standard Heart Disease Data set.
Code:
import pandas as pd
from pgmpy.models import DiscreteBayesianNetwork
from pgmpy.inference import VariableElimination
data = pd.read_csv("heart.csv")
data = data[["age", "cp", "thalach", "target"]]
data["age"] = pd.cut(
    data["age"],
    bins=[0, 40, 60, 100],
    labels=["Young", "Middle", "Old"]
)
data["thalach"] = pd.cut(
    data["thalach"],
    bins=[0, 120, 160, 250],
    labels=["low", "Normal", "High"]
)
model = DiscreteBayesianNetwork([
    ("age", "target"),
    ("cp", "target"),
    ("thalach", "target")
])
model.fit(data)
inference = VariableElimination(model)
result = inference.query(
    variables=["target"],
    evidence={
        "age": "Middle",
        "cp": 2,
        "thalach": "Normal"
    }
)
print(result)
print("\nDiagnosis:")
if result.values[1] > result.values[0]:
    print("Heart Disease")
else:
    print("NO Heart Disease")
